{"version":1,"content":"<p>感恩節假期後的美股迎來半日交易。美東時間周五，AI交易回暖，科技股反彈，美股三大指數強勢收尾，結束了跌宕起伏的一周。三大股指周五集體高開，早盤一度回吐大部分漲幅，隨後震蕩走高，<strong>並在尾盤快速拉升，最終道指和標普500指數均漲超1%，納指漲超2%。</strong></p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588296.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T07:47:10.615167+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T07:07:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:31.447730+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T07:40:31.447730+00:00","content_hash":"f97146599d72895197728c7f0bc85c34ea221ffeb06d2b66d94ab0aca92354a3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}